Here is a really minimalistic example of what does not work:

library(dplyr)
set.seed(100)
dfx <- data.frame(vara=factor(rep(c("a","b"),5)),varx=rnorm(10))
dfgr <- group_by(dfx,vara)

#the next line works as it should
summarise(dfgr,sss=sum(varx))
#and the following line does not work
summarise(dfgr,sss=sum(get("varx")))

In an ideal world, the second example also would work ;-)

