Why not teach them matrix multiplication:

> m <- matrix(1:20, 4)
> m
     [,1] [,2] [,3] [,4] [,5]
[1,]    1    5    9   13   17
[2,]    2    6   10   14   18
[3,]    3    7   11   15   19
[4,]    4    8   12   16   20

> m %*% c(1,1,1,1,1)
     [,1]
[1,]   45
[2,]   50
[3,]   55
[4,]   60

> m %*% c(1,1,1,1,1) / ncol(m)
     [,1]
[1,]    9
[2,]   10
[3,]   11
[4,]   12

--

Best;
David

